  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE COMPONENTS OF THE PROGRAM WOULD BE: (I) INSTITUTIONAL SUPPORT TO HIDROVEN AAS THE REGULATORY AGENCY; (II) INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING OF HIDROCAPITAL IN THE AREAS OF FINANCE AND OPERATIONS; (III) FINANCING OF REHABILITATION AND OPTIMIZATION WORKS; AND (IV) AN EDUCATION PROGRAM THAT WOULD PROMOTE COMMUNITY SUPPORT.</narrative>
